meta {
  name: Hotels
  type: folder
}

docs {
  # Hotel Management API

  This folder contains all hotel-related endpoints for Phase 2.

  ## Features
  - Hotel CRUD operations
  - Photo gallery management
  - Amenity management
  - Search and filtering
  - Owner statistics

  ## Authentication
  Most endpoints require Bearer token authentication.
  Use the token from login response.

  ## Endpoints
  - Public: View hotels, search, get details
  - Protected: Create, update, delete hotels (HOST/ADMIN only)
  - Owner: Modify own hotels only
}
